-- Double the catalog: more freelancers and listings per category (generated from prisma/bulk-gigs-data.ts).
-- Regenerated 2026-08-10: the original version of this migration mislabeled seller rows
-- (bulk-gigs-data.ts interleaves each category's "original" and "extra" sellers in one
-- flat array, but the migration assumed a non-interleaved layout), which both corrupted
-- already-deployed seller identities and left some gigs pointing at seller emails that
-- were never inserted. This version only inserts the genuinely new sellers (email number
-- > 60) under a distinct id namespace, and resolves every foreign key by email/slug lookup
-- instead of assuming a fixed id layout.

